  "text": {
    "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
    "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "nadia.conard@stryker.com",
    "text": "<p>Bronwen Taylor, vice president, compliance and risk management at Stryker, was honored with the&nbsp;2018&nbsp;PwC&nbsp;Award for Leadership in the Advancement of Ethics in the Medical Device&nbsp;Industry.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Presented at the&nbsp;11th&nbsp;annual Global&nbsp;MedTech&nbsp;Compliance Conference in&nbsp;Paris May&nbsp;2-4,&nbsp;the award&nbsp;is&nbsp;sponsored by PwC&nbsp;and&nbsp;given annually to&nbsp;an&nbsp;individual who has demonstrated outstanding leadership in the advancement of ethics and ethical behavior in the medical device and diagnostics&nbsp;industry.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>See full press release <a href=\"https://www.advamed.org/newsroom/press-releases/advamed-congratulates-stryker%E2%80%99s-bronwen-taylor-receiving-2018-pwc-medtech\">here</a>.&nbsp;</p>\n",
